{"id":"958dafb656cb78b0","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-cor-reflection-principle.md","title":"Brownian Reflection Principle","display":"cor-reflection-principle — Brownian Reflection Principle","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-reflection-principle","aliases":["58-cor-reflection-principle","Brownian Reflection Principle"],"display":"cor-reflection-principle — Brownian Reflection Principle","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-brownian.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-first-passage.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-reflection-principle"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-reflection-principle</span><span>Brownian Reflection Principle</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-reflection-principle — Brownian Reflection Principle"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8fc074624288fbbb\" href=\"?note=8fc074624288fbbb\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-brownian.md\">../batch15/58-df-brownian.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0883e36f1192a12f\" href=\"?note=0883e36f1192a12f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-first-passage.md\">../batch07/58-df-first-passage.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\in V\">\\(\\Omega\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\Omega)\">\\(\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\Omega)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P:\\mathcal F\\to[0,1]\">\\(\\mathbb P:\\mathcal F\\to[0,1]\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Brownian}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Brownian}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B:\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\to\\mathbb R^\\Omega\">\\(B:\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\to\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Brownian}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Brownian}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8fc074624288fbbb\" href=\"?note=8fc074624288fbbb\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-brownian.md\">../batch15/58-df-brownian.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\">\\(a\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\">\\(t\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_a:\\Omega\\to[0,\\infty]\">\\(\\tau_a:\\Omega\\to[0,\\infty]\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FirstPassageTime}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{FirstPassageTime}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FirstPassageTime}_S(\\tau_a,B,\\{a\\})\">\\(\\operatorname{FirstPassageTime}_S(\\tau_a,B,\\{a\\})\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0883e36f1192a12f\" href=\"?note=0883e36f1192a12f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-first-passage.md\">../batch07/58-df-first-passage.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>这里的概率空间完备：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall N\\in\\mathcal F\\;(\\mathbb P(N)=0\\to\\mathcal P(N)\\subseteq\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\forall N\\in\\mathcal F\\;(\\mathbb P(N)=0\\to\\mathcal P(N)\\subseteq\\mathcal F)\\)</span>。该条件也在两个断言的前件中出现，用于零概率异常路径上的事件可测性。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sup\">\\(\\sup\\)</span> 在扩展实序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[-\\infty,\\infty]\">\\([-\\infty,\\infty]\\)</span> 中取值，因 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,t]\\neq\\varnothing\">\\([0,t]\\neq\\varnothing\\)</span> 不出现空集上确界。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}principle\\text{-}maximum} \\vdash \\bigl[\\forall N\\in\\mathcal F\\;(\\mathbb P(N)=0\\to\\forall A\\subseteq N\\;A\\in\\mathcal F)\\bigr]\\land\\mathrm{Brownian}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land a\\geq0\\land t&gt;0\\to\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\left\\{\\omega_0\\in\\Omega:\\sup\\{B(s)(\\omega_0):s\\in[0,t]\\}\\geq a\\right\\}\\right)=2\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\{\\omega_0\\in\\Omega:B(t)(\\omega_0)\\geq a\\}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}principle\\text{-}maximum} \\vdash \\bigl[\\forall N\\in\\mathcal F\\;(\\mathbb P(N)=0\\to\\forall A\\subseteq N\\;A\\in\\mathcal F)\\bigr]\\land\\mathrm{Brownian}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land a\\geq0\\land t&gt;0\\to\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\left\\{\\omega_0\\in\\Omega:\\sup\\{B(s)(\\omega_0):s\\in[0,t]\\}\\geq a\\right\\}\\right)=2\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\{\\omega_0\\in\\Omega:B(t)(\\omega_0)\\geq a\\}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}principle\\text{-}hitting} \\vdash \\bigl[\\forall N\\in\\mathcal F\\;(\\mathbb P(N)=0\\to\\forall A\\subseteq N\\;A\\in\\mathcal F)\\bigr]\\land\\mathrm{Brownian}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\operatorname{FirstPassageTime}_S(\\tau_a,B,\\{a\\})\\land a\\geq0\\land t&gt;0\\to\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\{\\omega_0\\in\\Omega:\\tau_a(\\omega_0)\\leq t\\}\\right)=2\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\{\\omega_0\\in\\Omega:B(t)(\\omega_0)\\geq a\\}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}principle\\text{-}hitting} \\vdash \\bigl[\\forall N\\in\\mathcal F\\;(\\mathbb P(N)=0\\to\\forall A\\subseteq N\\;A\\in\\mathcal F)\\bigr]\\land\\mathrm{Brownian}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\operatorname{FirstPassageTime}_S(\\tau_a,B,\\{a\\})\\land a\\geq0\\land t&gt;0\\to\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\{\\omega_0\\in\\Omega:\\tau_a(\\omega_0)\\leq t\\}\\right)=2\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\{\\omega_0\\in\\Omega:B(t)(\\omega_0)\\geq a\\}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The qualifier “Brownian” distinguishes this result from the set-theoretic reflection principles.</li>\n<li>Reflection computes the displayed maximum and hitting probabilities.</li>\n<li>It uses symmetry of Brownian motion.</li>\n<li>Both stochastic predicates now have their exact arities recorded; the probability space and target level remain explicit arguments.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-brownian.md","status":"resolved","id":"8fc074624288fbbb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-brownian.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-first-passage.md","status":"resolved","id":"0883e36f1192a12f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-first-passage.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-brownian.md","status":"resolved","id":"8fc074624288fbbb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Brownian}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$, with $B:\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\to\\mathbb R^\\Omega$ and $\\mathrm{Brownian}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)$ (see [[../batch15/58-df-brownian.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-first-passage.md","status":"resolved","id":"0883e36f1192a12f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{FirstPassageTime}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ and $\\operatorname{FirstPassageTime}_S(\\tau_a,B,\\{a\\})$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-first-passage.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb P:\\mathcal F\\to[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Brownian}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"B:\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\to\\mathbb R^\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Brownian}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_a:\\Omega\\to[0,\\infty]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FirstPassageTime}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FirstPassageTime}_S(\\tau_a,B,\\{a\\})","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall N\\in\\mathcal F\\;(\\mathbb P(N)=0\\to\\mathcal P(N)\\subseteq\\mathcal F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sup","display":false},{"tex":"[-\\infty,\\infty]","display":false},{"tex":"[0,t]\\neq\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}principle\\text{-}maximum} \\vdash \\bigl[\\forall N\\in\\mathcal F\\;(\\mathbb P(N)=0\\to\\forall A\\subseteq N\\;A\\in\\mathcal F)\\bigr]\\land\\mathrm{Brownian}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land a\\geq0\\land t>0\\to\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\left\\{\\omega_0\\in\\Omega:\\sup\\{B(s)(\\omega_0):s\\in[0,t]\\}\\geq a\\right\\}\\right)=2\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\{\\omega_0\\in\\Omega:B(t)(\\omega_0)\\geq a\\}\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}principle\\text{-}hitting} \\vdash \\bigl[\\forall N\\in\\mathcal F\\;(\\mathbb P(N)=0\\to\\forall A\\subseteq N\\;A\\in\\mathcal F)\\bigr]\\land\\mathrm{Brownian}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\operatorname{FirstPassageTime}_S(\\tau_a,B,\\{a\\})\\land a\\geq0\\land t>0\\to\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\{\\omega_0\\in\